261c			; op codes for forth keywords 
261c			 
261c			; Changing use of opcodes to flag is the word exists in compiled form or not.  
261c			; This provides a means to compile uwords if required for higher performance 
261c			; by avoiding the use of the keyword parser and just jumping directly to the code 
261c			; Actually there is already a flag for if the code exists as binary thinking about it... 
261c			 
